e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MCFmUTIb2SYQ7kNvwGkMU6W&_nc_oc=AdmJYX6jmDwEwVsEakuniv3h9n-5V-iUNoojlASfD7eH-YaxNw1JCtcY3X9v6N_CrSA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsKUS_HpM0K1VETG2-sFM2x88HqCTX5hbCl6jfG0qG73g&oe=699AEE6B"}, "display_name": "Mystery Box VR: Hidden Secrets Escape", "keywords": ["puzzle", "escape", "room", "trivia", "brainteaser"], "long_description": "# AN IMMERSIVE VR PUZZLE EXPERIENCE\nInteract with objects, handles, buttons, and wheels on each side. Crack enigmas and collect hidden puzzle tiles on a random side of the boxes.\n\nYou won't be able to compare reality with fiction.\n\n# DISCOVER INVENTIONS\nOnce you unlock all 8 boxes of a Level Pack, you can compose a puzzle and discover a brief history of an invention.\n\nIt's not always easy to escape the room, so use all your IQ to crack the riddles. There's a logic behind all of them, even where it seems it's not!\n\n# IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK\nPlay the game with your headphones to get immersed in this amazing adventure.\n\n# HINTS\nGot stuck on some enigma? No worries, you can still get a helpful hint! You can also get in touch with me in case you really can't make it through a riddle, I'll be glad to help ;)\n\n# MULTILANGUAGE\nAvailable in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese.\n\nThe game language will change automatically based on the language settings of your device", "short_description": "Crack awesome puzzles around many boxes, and discover the history of the world's most popular inventions!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "logoTransparent.png", "id": "3812261432362188", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974562_3812261435695521_5176404439574971225_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mtM-TGw1euAQ7kNvwGbhNO-&_nc_oc=Adl1PkXUTgu4R3Yxrc6T8QsuD83qEld0GX73g2mlI7gWJj7AgFfPtKAO2yTPCeA_lCc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft-Z_ZrvcKi_KQjZNAiiL5pgyptddO4_ktjViQrgJtHi