oc=AdmKLkE10ru4E4eoPtcm6-lj8m9m4ov99yRivzYgwJrzJLGwjrI4SOx0WaRhdXG3T-s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftS74TfM1kduYhJQs01MD7Ew-MYI86CAEcGd7eA1lyHKA&oe=699AEBF3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1524760081483769", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974531_1524760084817102_6497712644828891067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5HTgh19YnjkQ7kNvwHrdUW5&_nc_oc=Adn2xf5o8kXLFPG9-yUeqVuyUyazyaGDm03XgT-x0rj_yrTCLklADNixS2jrxEp9M5s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afsu458lBSVUL4GM7zXUd3dzNcKEJjhG6Lq4h-rOkHbeBw&oe=699AEAEF"}, "display_name": "Mystery Box VR: Hidden Secrets", "keywords": [], "long_description": " AN IMMERSIVE VR PUZZLE EXPERIENCE\nInteract with objects, handles, buttons, and wheels on each side. Crack enigmas and collect hidden puzzle tiles on a random side of the boxes.\n\nYou won't be able to compare reality with fiction.\n\n# DISCOVER INVENTIONS\nOnce you unlock all 8 boxes of a Level Pack, you can compose a puzzle and discover a brief history of an invention.\n\nIt's not always easy to escape the room, so use all your IQ to crack the riddles. There's a logic behind all of them, even where it seems it's not!\n\n# IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK\nPlay the game with your headphones to get immersed in this amazing adventure.\n\n# HINTS\nGot stuck on some enigma? No worries, you can still get a helpful hint! You can also get in touch with me in case you really can't make it through a riddle, I'll be glad to help ;)\n\n# MULTILANGUAGE\nAvailable in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese.\n\nThe game language will change automatically based on the language settings of your device", "short_description": "A VR escape room game where you have to solve intriguing riddles to open boxes and discover nice stories about popular inventions!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "$R36BSY5.png", "id": "3678762505771822", 